# Microservice: Auth Service Tasks
# Copy to services/auth/ as .tasks.auth
# Run: run auth <task>

# Setup
0|Install|npm install|Install dependencies
0|Db Init|npm run db:init|Initialize database
0|Seeds|npm run db:seed|Seed test data

# Development
0|Dev|npm run dev|Start dev server (with reload)
0|Test Local|npm run test|Run tests locally
0|Build Local|npm run build|Build locally

# Quality Assurance
0|Quality|SUB|Quality assurance
1|Lint|npm run lint|Lint code
1|Format|npm run format|Format code
1|Type Check|npm run type-check|Type checking
1|QA|npm run lint && npm run format && npm run type-check [depends: Lint,Format,Type Check]|Full QA
1|Back|BACK

# Testing
0|Testing|SUB|Testing suite
1|Unit Tests|npm run test:unit|Unit tests
1|Integration|npm run test:integration|Integration tests
1|E2E|npm run test:e2e|End-to-end tests
1|All Tests|npm run test [depends: Unit Tests,Integration,E2E]|All tests (parallel)
1|Coverage|npm run test:coverage|Coverage report
1|Back|BACK

# Docker
0|Docker|SUB|Docker tasks
1|Docker Build|docker build -t auth:latest .|Build Docker image
1|Docker Run|docker run -p 3001:3001 auth:latest|Run in Docker
1|Docker Test|docker build -f Dockerfile.test -t auth:test . && docker run auth:test|Test in Docker
1|Back|BACK

# Deployment
0|Deployment|SUB|Deployment tasks
1|Deploy Dev|kubectl apply -f k8s/dev/auth.yaml|Deploy to dev
1|Deploy Stage|kubectl apply -f k8s/staging/auth.yaml|Deploy to staging
1|Deploy Prod|kubectl apply -f k8s/prod/auth.yaml|Deploy to production
1|Back|BACK

# Status
0|Status|SUB|Service status
1|Health|curl -s http://localhost:3001/health | jq|Check health
1|Status Check|kubectl get pods -l app=auth|Pod status
1|Logs|kubectl logs -f deployment/auth|View logs
1|Metrics|curl -s http://localhost:3001/metrics|Metrics
1|Back|BACK

# Maintenance
0|Maintenance|SUB|Maintenance & rollout
1|Restart Dev|kubectl rollout restart deployment/auth -n dev|Restart dev
1|Restart Stage|kubectl rollout restart deployment/auth -n staging|Restart staging
1|Restart Prod|kubectl rollout restart deployment/auth -n prod|Restart prod
1|Rollback|kubectl rollout undo deployment/auth|Rollback to previous
1|Back|BACK

# Database
0|Database|SUB|Database migrations
1|Db Migrate|npm run db:migrate|Run migrations
1|Db Rollback|npm run db:rollback|Rollback migrations
1|Db Reset|npm run db:reset|Reset database
1|Back|BACK

0|Exit|EXIT|Close menu
